---
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();

const policyLinks = [
  {
    href: "/polisi-penghantaran",
    label: "Polisi Penghantaran",
    enLabel: "Shipping & Delivery Policy",
  },
  {
    href: "/polisi-pemulangan",
    label: "Polisi Pemulangan & Bayaran Balik",
    enLabel: "Refund & Return Policy",
  },
  {
    href: "/terma-dan-syarat",
    label: "Terma dan Syarat",
    enLabel: "Terms & Conditions",
  },
  {
    href: "/polisi-privasi",
    label: "Polisi Privasi",
    enLabel: "Privacy Policy",
  },
];
---

<footer class="border-t border-slate-800 bg-putrajaya-navy py-12 text-sm text-slate-300 sm:py-16">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-10 md:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-12">
      <div class="md:col-span-7">
        <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-yellow-400">
          Maklumat Syarikat &amp; Hubungan Rasmi
        </p>
        <p class="mt-2 text-lg font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white">
          BRAINWAVE COMMUNICATIONS{" "}
          <span class="font-semibold text-yellow-400">
            (202203208117 / JM0967023-W)
          </span>
        </p>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-300">
          Penerbit bersama dan pengedar rasmi buku{" "}
          <strong class="font-semibold text-white">
            Siapa Akan Menguasai Putrajaya?
          </strong>{" "}
          karya Ronifira Rejab (ISBN 978-967-5131-28-8, diterbitkan bersama
          Prestasi Media).
        </p>

        <dl class="mt-5 grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-700 bg-slate-900/70 p-4 text-xs sm:grid-cols-2 sm:p-5">
          <div class="sm:col-span-2">
            <dt class="font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400">
              Alamat Perniagaan
            </dt>
            <dd class="mt-1 text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed text-white">
              BRAINWAVE COMMUNICATIONS (202203208117 / JM0967023-W)<br />
              2-1B, Jalan UP1/1, Ukay Perdana, 68000 Ampang, Selangor, Malaysia.
            </dd>
          </div>

          <div>
            <dt class="font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400">
              Telefon / WhatsApp
            </dt>
            <dd class="mt-1">
              <a
                href="tel:+60108725969"
                class="inline-flex min-h-[44px] items-center rounded-lg border border-slate-500 bg-putrajaya-navy px-3.5 py-2 text-sm font-semibold tabular-nums text-yellow-400 transition hover:border-yellow-400 hover:bg-slate-800 hover:text-yellow-300 active:translate-y-px focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-yellow-400"
              >
                +6010 872 5969
              </a>
            </dd>
          </div>

          <div>
            <dt class="font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400">
              E-mel Rasmi
            </dt>
            <dd class="mt-1">
              <a
                href="mailto:ronifira@gmail.com"
                class="inline-flex min-h-[44px] items-center rounded-lg border border-slate-500 bg-putrajaya-navy px-3.5 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-yellow-400 transition hover:border-yellow-400 hover:bg-slate-800 hover:text-yellow-300 active:translate-y-px focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-yellow-400"
              >
                ronifira@gmail.com
              </a>
            </dd>
          </div>
        </dl>
      </div>

      <div class="md:col-span-5">
        <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-yellow-400">
          Dokumen &amp; Polisi Rasmi
        </p>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-300">
          Rujukan rasmi syarat pembelian, jadual penghantaran pra-jualan,
          pemulangan dan perlindungan data pelanggan:
        </p>

        <nav aria-label="Pautan Polisi dan Undang-Undang" class="mt-4">
          <ul class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-2.5">
            {policyLinks.map((link) => (
              <li>
                <a
                  href={link.href}
                  class="flex min-h-[48px] flex-col justify-center rounded-xl border border-slate-500 bg-slate-900 px-4 py-2.5 transition hover:border-yellow-400 hover:bg-slate-800 active:translate-y-px focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-yellow-400"
                >
                  <span class="text-sm font-bold text-white">{link.label}</span>
                  <span class="text-xs text-slate-400">{link.enLabel}</span>
                </a>
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 border-t border-slate-800 pt-6 text-center text-xs text-slate-400 sm:flex sm:items-center sm:justify-between sm:text-left">
      <p>
        &copy; {currentYear} BRAINWAVE COMMUNICATIONS (SSM: 202203208117 /
        JM0967023-W). Hak Cipta Terpelihara.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-2 sm:mt-0">
        Semua transaksi pembayaran dalam talian diproses dengan selamat melalui
        CHIP Collect.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
